8. What does the following output, and what scope concept does it demonstrate?
public class Chain {
    int x = 1;
    void method1() {
        int x = 2;
        method2();
        System.out.println(x);
    }
    void method2() {
        x = 99;
        System.out.println(x);
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) { new Chain().method1(); }
}
